wesome!! It was our first time in NOLA and we got to experience this spot because it was the end of a haunted pub tour (which you should go on btw). We were hungry when we started the tour and man were we so excited that this was the last stop because WHO DOESN'T LOVE PIZZA?! Okay so this isn't normal pizza, this is cool pizza. Haha but really, we had pepperoni slices because they sale by the slice or whole. But there are no words to describe how good this pizza was, it was cheesy and not overly greasy. It was the perfect temperature and the crust was perfect! It was crispy at the bottom but was not burnt. The crust reminded me of brick oven pizza crusts and was charred a b..."},{"business_id":"fyVp9XdUrcMxBUn4h1ZmmQ","review_id":"iIgVJghiZdQ5uCSmWVN-dw","date":"2021-11-07T02:14:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9247859120368958,"text_excerpt":"Really cute place! Love the theme and love the decor. They really commit to the treehouse vibe. Music is on point too, they were playing some classic 90s angsty teen music when I came in and it immediately gave me a sense of nostalgia. The pizza was surprisingly delicious! Thin crust and loaded with toppings. So tasty and it's a huge slice for $5 Highly recommend stopping in for a late night slice"},{"business_id":"fyVp9XdUrcMxBUn4h1ZmmQ","review_id":"Y-J2bAPZVlQmQ4w9PCMd6w","date":"2020-02-29T17:25:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9231966733932495,"text_excerpt":"This review is for drinks/atmosphere only as I couldn't eat the pizza. They didn't do gluten-free. I found this place before the ghost walking tour I was about to take. Raven's Omen met on the corner across from the bar. It was raining, and I was about an hour early, so I ducked into the Treehouse, but I'd been thinking I should stop in anyway. I had to use the washroom and promised the guy I'd order once out. He looked a little doubtful at first, but he probably gets a lot of a-holes who pee and run during Mardi Gras lol. OMG if I thought the front of the bar was cute...well, the washroom was adorable. There was a flower-filled meadow on the wall and stickers everywhere. Loved one said \"..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"fyVp9XdUrcMxBUn4h1ZmmQ","photo_id":"R9tkEvAVRzSRpzp3N-A2dg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/R9tkEvAVRzSRpzp3N-A2dg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9700602293014526},{"business_id":"fyVp9XdUrcMxBUn4h1ZmmQ","photo_id":"Vh7YGVx6PgPwfEvT0fwpIg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Vh7YGVx6PgPwfEvT0fwpIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9700601696968079}]},"notebook_case":null}
